   <title><![CDATA[National Abortion Controversy & More Riot and the Dance with ND Wilson (FlashBack Friday) [CrossPolitic Show]]]></title>
   <link/>
   <description><![CDATA[<p>This week we were joined by author and filmmaker N.D. Wilson. N.D.'s last book in his trilogy Outlaws of Time, The Last of the Lost Boys, comes out April 17th! Pre-order now! Riot and the Dance will get an encore showing for April 19th. This is a big deal, so please invite your friends, and if you have already seen it, go a second time! Check here for your local listings and to purchase tickets. In CrossPolitic news, we cover the fallout from our Lt. Governor's live show, and how Christians should be thinking about how we should move forward with ending abortion.&nbsp;</p>]]></description>
